  {
   "id": 6,
   "title": "The Night the Barn Cats Unionized and Demanded Better Tuna, Heated Beds, and a Formal Grievance Process",
   "tags": [
    3,
    5,
    6
   ],
   "pub": "2026-06-21 22:00:00",
   "mod": "2026-10-09 07:30:00",
   "read": 8,
   "author": "Bai Tu",
   "intro": "<p>It started with a single cat on the hay bales at midnight. By morning there were <strong>eleven of them</strong>, a list of demands scratched into the feed log, and a picket line between the barn and the house. Negotiations are ongoing. The tuna budget has already been revised upward twice, and the heated beds arrive Thursday.</p>",
   "img": "data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201000%201300%22%20width%3D%221000%22%20height%3D%221300%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22s%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%220%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22hsl%2815%2C70%25%2C72%25%29%22/%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22hsl%2855%2C80%25%2C88%25%29%22/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%221000%22%20height%3D%221300%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%23s%29%22/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22600%22%20cy%3D%22416%22%20r%3D%22110%22%20fill%3D%22hsl%2875%2C95%25%2C85%25%29%22/%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20910%20Q%20300%20650%20600%20884%20T%201000%20806%20V%201300%20H%200Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl%28165%2C35%25%2C42%25%29%22/%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%201066%20Q%20450%20858%201000%201092%20V%201300%20H%200Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl%28175%2C40%25%2C30%25%29%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E",
